%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHuh?! No way!!\d%K%P
「诶～！？\n骗人！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI'm not lying. It was only my third day, and he didn't\neven care that I was way above him as far as our positions\nin the company were concerned.\d%K%P
「怎么会是骗你的呢？\n第三天一上来就是这个呢！\n而且，还是对身居高职的人哦？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI can't believe Osamu said something that harsh... I've\nnever seen him act anywhere near close to that here!\d%K%P
「理君会说这种严厉的话…\n光是看公寓里的理君的话绝对想象不到啊～」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI told you he was simply being nice in front of you. In\nreality, he's as cold-blooded as they come.\d%K%P
「所以才说嘛。\n他在小都子面前隐藏了本性哦。\n本性其实是个没血没泪的魔鬼」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI-I see...\d%K%P
「是、是这样吗…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAnd even though I have my position and my family to fall\nback upon, in the end, I'm just a university student, so I\ncouldn't tell him off.\d%K%P
「然后啊，虽说我确实被捧得上了天，\n但本职不就只是个大学生嘛？\n到头来，什么反驳都没说出来」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dS-So what did you do, then?\d%K%P
「发、发生什么了？然后呢？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI cried. I locked myself in the bathroom for ten minutes\nand bawled my eyes out. I was just so frustrated, I didn't\nknow what else to do...\d%K%P
「哭了。在洗手间整整哭了十分钟。\n不甘心不甘心得不得了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHimeo...\d%K%P
「姫绪、姐…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAfter that, I washed my face before I went back to my\nseat so no one would know I was crying. It was a real pain\nto try to hide, since I'm in the same office as everyone\nelse.\d%K%P
「然后拼命地洗了脸，像什么都没发生过一样回到了位置上。\n…大家都是同事，要瞒过他们也十分不容易啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI see...\d%K%P
「是这样啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dBut you wouldn't believe what happened next. He comes up\nto me and demands I do regular hours today of all days. Is\nthat something you say to a girl that just cried herself\ndry?\d%K%P
「但是呢，在那之后，那个男人变本加厉了。\n说『从今天开始会严格地检查你是否准时』，\n一般会对一个刚哭过的女孩子说那样的话吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dO-Osamu did that?\d%K%P
「理、理君他？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI'm not saying he's wrong or anything, it's just that the\nway he's treating me is obviously lacking in affection! He\nhas no love in his heart! I bet that story about him being\nKamata's savior is bogus as well. Hmph.\d%K%P
「虽然说得很正确，\n但该怎么说呢…爱不够啊爱。\n宣扬的什么镰田的救世主，这事很可疑呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dKamata's... savior...?\d%K%P
「镰田？\n救世主？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAh, um... That's a different matter entirely, so just\nforget about it.\d%K%P
「啊，那个是…和这件事没有关系就先跳过」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen... what was that about love? You wanted him to love\nyou?\d%K%P
「那…关于爱呢？\n姫绪姐，想得到理君的爱吗？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dUm... That is also a different matter entirely.\d%K%P
「呃…这也与这件事没有关系」%K%P
